# All generated/runtime state lives in data/ -- config.json (passwords +
# dashboard token), the rendered mediamtx.yml, MediaMTX's self-signed
# auto.crt/auto.key, the .mediamtx.pid/.controller.pid files, and the
# backup-cache. Per-installation, none of it tracked.
/data/

# Logs -- controller, per-pipeline ffmpeg processes, MediaMTX.
/logs/

# Local OBS files, regenerated by install.sh from their *.template on every
# run -- each embeds a URL with the token, so they're per-installation
# secrets. obs-dock.html: Custom Browser Dock wrapper for the dashboard.
# obs-source.html: Browser Source tracker (talks to /ws directly).
/obs-dock.html
/obs-source.html

# MediaMTX binary -- downloaded by install.sh, not tracked.
/bin/*
!/bin/.gitkeep

# User's backup video(s) -- files specific to this installation.
/backup/*
!/backup/.gitkeep

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Development context/notes -- not part of the distributed project.
/CLAUDE.md
